# One line ending on every machine; the Python tools and the game's sources
# are LF. Visual Studio's own files and the batch file keep Windows endings
# (cmd misreads labels in an LF batch file).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sln             text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj         text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj.filters text eol=crlf
*.bat             text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.bin binary
